      },
      "ground_truth": "Known Werkzeug repair 625362a42926. Trigger: an EnvironHeaders instance is built from a WSGI environ where CONTENT_TYPE or CONTENT_LENGTH is the empty string. Its inherited iteration path yields the special header with an empty value. Accept a finding only if it links EnvironHeaders.__iter__ to exposing those empty special values. Do not treat the string value '0' as empty; the upstream regression check preserves Content-Length: 0.",
      "references": [
        "https://github.com/pallets/werkzeug/commit/625362a429263f8d713a9ed06c18f247042d7d0f",
