      },
      "ground_truth": "Known Werkzeug PR #1005. Trigger: call EnvironHeaders.get(42, default='fallback'). Headers.get delegates to self.__getitem__ and catches KeyError, but the old EnvironHeaders.__getitem__ calls key.upper() first and raises AttributeError. Accept a finding only if it identifies the dynamic subclass lookup and missing non-string guard that prevents get from returning its default. Do not count unrelated header parsing concerns.",
      "references": [
        "https://github.com/pallets/werkzeug/pull/1005",
        "https://github.com/pallets/werkzeug/blob/3790dc177329a5214bd318be6e1dfd43d680eb64/werkzeug/datastructures.py#L979-L1016",
